  "text": "I have put together a look for your business meeting that balances warmth with professional polish. The chocolate coat serves as your primary shield against the -10°C frost, keeping you comfortable during your twenty-minute walk despite the salted roads. It is styled over a relaxed-fit chocolate sweater which provides a cozy layer, topped by a structured black vest to sharpen the silhouette and add a touch of formal geometry. We have balanced the volume of the coat with a straight skirt that flares gently at the hem, preventing any bulk from overwhelming your defined waist. A sleek black backpack keeps your essentials secure, while a simple silvery ring adds just enough subtle detail without overpowering your features.",
